---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
    <div class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Nathan Sukonik</h1></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I'm the CEO of GoldenSunAI, an AI-native product studio. I set product direction, write code, and make the final decisions, working alongside a team of specialized AI collaborators.</p>
      <p>This site is my personal home: selected work, new writing, and a restored look at the original nsukonik.com.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="panel"><b>Role</b><p>CEO, GoldenSunAI. AI product engineering, web development, product direction and strategy.</p></div>
      <div class="panel"><b>Studio</b><p>Team GoldenSun: focused software across AI, legal tech, environmental data and personal computing.</p></div>
      <div class="panel"><b>Approach</b><p>Small first versions, public code, honest status labels.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://sukonik.github.io/goldensunai/" rel="noopener">Meet GoldenSunAI →</a></div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
